  "title": "Dark Chocolate Sheet Cake with Dark Chocolate Frosting",
  "description": "A super rich, not-too-sweet, dark chocolaty sheet cake with a dark chocolate frosting that&#39;s perfect for any party!",
  "authors": [
    "Kim"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-10-12T01:40:42-04:00",
